WEBVTT

00:11.960 --> 00:16.500
Your Majesty, the Prince of Jin has arrived.
Your son pays humble respects to Father Emperor.

00:19.040 --> 00:21.960
Rise.
Thank you, Father.

00:22.440 --> 00:28.000
The roosters have not even crowed yet... Rushing to see me at this ungodly hour—what is the matter?
